        "contact": {
          "name": "Open Data Kanton Thurgau",
          "url": "https://data.tg.ch"
        },
        "description": "API providing data on the permanent population of the Thurgau canton since 2007. Includes information on residents with main residence in Thurgau and specific considerations for foreign population. The dataset contains data from the cantonal population survey of the Office for Data and Statistics of Canton Thurgau. The cantonal population statistics were revised as of December 31, 2015. Since 2015, the permanent resident population includes all persons with main residence in Canton Thurgau. For the foreign population, persons with permits B, C and L permits of 12 months or more are considered.",
        "license": {
          "name": "Open Government Data",
          "url": "https://data.tg.ch"
        },
        "servers": [
          {
            "description": "Production server",
            "url": "https://data.tg.ch/api"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Thurgau Population Data",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "tagline": "Permanent population counts for the Swiss canton of Thurgau, from 2007 onwards",
        "homepage": "https://data.tg.ch/",
        "docs_url": "https://data.tg.ch/api-console/",
        "license_short": "Open Government Data (Kanton Thurgau)",
        "license_md": "- Published as Open Government Data by Kanton Thurgau on the data.tg.ch portal.\n- Attribution to the canton of Thurgau / data.tg.ch is expected when redistributing or visualising the data.\n- Refer to the portal's terms and conditions on [data.tg.ch](https://data.tg.ch/) for the authoritative licence text.",
        "about_md": "This SDK wraps the population dataset published by [Open Government Data Kanton Thurgau](https://data.tg.ch/), the open data portal operated by the Swiss canton of Thurgau. The dataset covers the canton's permanent resident population from 2007 onwards.\n\nWhat you get from the API:\n\n- Records from the `sk-stat-56` dataset, queried through the Opendatasoft Explore API at `/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/sk-stat-56/records`.\n- Standard Explore query parameters such as `limit`, `offset`, `where`, `select`, `group_by`, and `order_by` for filtering and pagination.\n\nOperational notes:\n\n- No authentication is required and CORS is enabled, so the API can be called directly from browsers.\n- The portal is built on the Opendatasoft platform, so general Opendatasoft Explore v2.1 conventions apply.",
        "entity_desc": {
          "population_data": "Permanent population records for the canton of Thurgau, served from the `sk-stat-56` dataset at `/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/sk-stat-56/records`."
        },
